&lt;li&gt;Fix chat template cache key order: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/41517&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/41517/hovercard&quot;&gt;#41517&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Rust Server&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The experimental Rust router and frontend (&lt;code&gt;experimental/sgl-router&lt;/code&gt;, the Rust renderer) keep moving toward parity with the Python server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Rust Renderer] Standalone preprocessing: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36718&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36718/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36718&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
