&lt;h2&gt;Simulator&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A CPU-only inference simulator under &lt;code&gt;tools/sglang-simulator&lt;/code&gt; that reuses the real scheduler and cache stack with a latency predictor in place of the model forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Simulator] Add high-fidelity CPU-based inference simulator: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33824&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33824/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33824&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Simulator] Give the OFFLINE/BLOCKING comparison tolerances real headroom: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/38732&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/38732/hovercard&quot;&gt;#38732&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
