&lt;h2&gt;HiCache &amp;amp; Radix Cache&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using unified radix tree by default for all case: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35081&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35081/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35081&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
