&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Fix PP inconsistency with HiCache L3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4246104988&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22607&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22607/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22607&quot;&gt;#22607&lt;/a&gt;): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/27010&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/27010/hovercard&quot;&gt;#27010&lt;/a&gt; ⭐&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Radix Cache] Add Rust TreeCore backend with shared parity tests: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32710&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32710/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32710&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Unified Cache][1/N]: Support cache contract for external linker: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37091&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37091/hovercard&quot;&gt;#37091&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
