&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Buffer-only mode for HiCache host memory layer: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34798&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34798/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34798&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] buffer mode: decide staged-fetch fate against the live tree: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36834&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36834/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36834&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix buffer-mode HiCache load-back ownership races; add optional prefetch anchor lock: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35769&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35769/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35769&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Batch PP write and load completion sync: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33473&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33473/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33473&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Stop populating host-pool mmaps twice (-13% allocation time): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36705&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36705/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36705&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Retry L3 storage prefetch after a missed attempt: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36227&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36227/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36227&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiSparse] Support hisparse multi-step swap io kernel (batch-64 swap latency -48.2% on H20): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32162&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32162/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32162&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(unified-memory): dense KV views for uniform-row MHA/SWA models: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34602&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34602/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34602&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
