&lt;li&gt;feat(unified-memory): byte-budget sizing, feasibility floor, and a conservation verifier: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35158&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35158/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35158&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Unified Memory] Stop eviction when shared allocation capacity is sufficient (cache survival 35.7% to 67.9%, replay E2E -37.9%): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33091&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33091/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33091&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
