&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Perf] PaddleOCR-VL: overlap page preprocessing, pack the ViT, enable prefill CUDA graph (1080p page TTFT 235 ms to 120 ms, 1.84x req/s on H200): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35318&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35318/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35318&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
