&lt;li&gt;[VLM] Split Pixtral multi-image features before the CUDA IPC wrap: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35463&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35463/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35463&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
