&lt;li&gt;[Fix] Re-encode multimodal embeddings after cache mismatch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36595&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36595/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36595&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Fix][VLM] keep Qwen3-VL MoE inference deepstack order: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34690&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34690/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34690&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Kimi-K3] Fix &quot;wrong grids&quot; crash in DP-sharded vision preprocessing: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35305&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35305/hovercard&quot;&gt;#35305&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
