&lt;li&gt;[AMD] Fix the QuickReduce bf16 cast failing to build for CDNA: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37132&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/37132/hovercard&quot;&gt;#37132&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(lora): build the MoE LoRA align JIT kernel on ROCm: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36379&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36379/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36379&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AMD] Fix nightly ROCm 7.0 image build: patch missing &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;optional&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; include in AITER topk kernel: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36216&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/36216/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36216&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AMD] Keep the PTX-inline-asm diffusion norm fusions off on ROCm (fix FLUX warmup crash): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34481&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34481/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34481&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AMD] Let the diffusion AITer backend take grouped-query K/V (fix Cosmos3-Nano startup): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34485&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34485/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34485&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
