&lt;li&gt;[XPU] Use a fused GDN kernel from sgl-kernel for Qwen3.5 (Qwen3.5 GDN prefill 165 ms to 59 ms): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33354&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33354/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33354&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
