&lt;li&gt;fix(xpu): enable compressed-tensors FP8 W8A8 on XPU (RedHatAI FP8-dynamic models): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33057&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33057/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33057&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
