&lt;li&gt;[npu] [bugfix] Fix HiCache MHA backup for NPU: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34341&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/34341/hovercard&quot;&gt;#34341&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
