&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Kimi] Support kimi-k3: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32541&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32541/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32541&lt;/a&gt; ⭐&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Kimi] Support DCP + DSpark (ported from kimi-k3 branch): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32828&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32828/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32828&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
