&lt;li&gt;feat(kernels): port standalone Kimi K3 kernels: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32890&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32890/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32890&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Feat] DCP + HiCache L2 Support (ported from kimi-k3): &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33112&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33112/hovercard&quot;&gt;#33112&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
