&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/compare/v0.5.16...v0.5.17&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.5.16...v0.5.17&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
