&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[HiCache] Add the FlexKV storage connector: &lt;code&gt;--enable-flexkv&lt;/code&gt; routes the KV cache through FlexKV&#39;s KVManager for host-tier offload, configured via &lt;code&gt;--flexkv-config-file&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29701&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29701/hovercard&quot;&gt;#29701&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
