  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/740303686/v0.5.15.post1</id>
    <updated>2026-07-14T08:43:33Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/releases/tag/v0.5.15.post1"/>
    <title>v0.5.15.post1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;v0.5.15.post1 includes a few patches, mostly for GLM 5.2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4833607664&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/30454&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30454/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30454&quot;&gt;#30454&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4844858290&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/30627&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30627/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30627&quot;&gt;#30627&lt;/a&gt;: Fix DSA model launching on non Cuda/HIP devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4861796866&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/30858&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30858/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30858&quot;&gt;#30858&lt;/a&gt;: Fix flashinfer dependency on Cuda 12 images&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4871735633&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/31001&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31001/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/31001&quot;&gt;#31001&lt;/a&gt;: Fix NaN outputs caused by flashinfer trtllm FP4 MoE kernels on long input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4860685418&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/30839&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30839/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30839&quot;&gt;#30839&lt;/a&gt;: Fix GLM 5.2 IndexShare on PD disaggregation setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4871214944&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/30992&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30992/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/30992&quot;&gt;#30992&lt;/a&gt;: Fix GLM 5.2 IndexShare on Context Parallel setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>Fridge003</name>
    </author>
