&lt;li&gt;feat(sgl-kernel): add InfLLM v2 attention kernels: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29383&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29383/hovercard&quot;&gt;#29383&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
